Script /mice/LAD/scripts/1_run_HHMs.py outputs several types of files.

1) Full summary of two HMMs
Includes for each HMM emissions in each state and numbers and proportions of both sites and segments in each state.
/mice/LAD/results/hmm_summary.tsv

2) HMM asymmetry emissions and sites for clonal and subclonal mutations
/mice/LAD/results/HMM_ploidy/*.bw.tsv

3) Observed correspondances of asymmetry states between clonal and subclonal mutations
/mice/LAD/results/HMM_ploidy/*.cloneAs.tsv

4) Info about fit of vaf distributions as a mixture of two normal distributions
/mice/LAD/results/HMM_ploidy/*.cloneSize.tsv